1. Extract common quiz logic into reusable methods
You have very similar loops in multipleChoiceQuestion() and trueOrFalseQuestion(). Extract that logic into one method that handles any kind of question, using parameters or interfaces.

2. Create a Question interface or abstract class
Define a common interface or abstract class for question types with methods like:

