interface QuestionType {
    String[] getQuestions();
    String[][] getOptions(); // returns null for T/F type or empty array
    String[] getAnswer();
    boolean hasOptions();
}
Implement this in both MultipleChoiceQuestion and TrueOrFalseQuestion. This way, you can write one generic method to ask any type of question.

3. Unified method to run quiz for any question type
Example:

