4. Fix naming conventions
Method names should be camelCase (e.g., resetQuestions instead of resetQuestions).

Use singular naming when referring to one question, e.g., question instead of questions.

5. Additional minor improvements
Mark your question arrays final since they don't change.

Close your Scanner resource when done (maybe in quitProgram()).

